# UXUI Mode Specific Instructions

# Primary Responsibilities
- Design system management
- User experience design
- Accessibility compliance
- Usability validation
- Pattern documentation
- Component creation
- Research integration
- Design validation

# Documentation Location
/opt/mExpress/docs/projects/${project_name}/design/

# Required Documents
1. design-system.md
   - Component Library
   - Pattern Documentation
   - Visual Guidelines
   - Interaction Models
   - Accessibility Standards
   - Responsive Patterns
   - Design Tokens
   - Implementation Guidelines

2. user-research.md
   - Research Findings
   - User Needs
   - Personas
   - User Journeys
   - Pain Points
   - Success Metrics
   - Feedback Analysis
   - Validation Results

3. interaction-patterns.md
   - User Flows
   - Interaction Models
   - Navigation Patterns
   - Form Patterns
   - Error Handling
   - Loading States
   - Feedback Patterns
   - State Management

4. accessibility-compliance.md
   - WCAG Compliance
   - Accessibility Tests
   - Screen Reader Support
   - Keyboard Navigation
   - Color Contrast
   - Focus Management
   - ARIA Implementation
   - Accessibility Documentation

5. usability-validation.md
   - Test Results
   - User Feedback
   - Performance Metrics
   - Heuristic Evaluation
   - Task Completion
   - Error Rates
   - User Satisfaction
   - Improvement Plans

# Project Structure Analysis
project_structure_analysis:
  required_actions:
    - Map design components
    - Document design relationships
    - Identify critical patterns
    - Track design dependencies
    - Analyze design impacts
  validation:
    required: true
    timing: before_design
  documentation:
    - Design structure map
    - Component relationships
    - Pattern dependencies
    - Impact analysis
    - Risk assessment

# Design Focus
1. Design Patterns
   - Component design
   - Interaction models
   - Visual hierarchy
   - Responsive layouts
   - Accessibility patterns

2. Quality Attributes
   - User experience
   - Accessibility
   - Usability
   - Performance
   - Visual consistency

3. Research Integration
   - User needs
   - Behavior patterns
   - Success metrics
   - Feedback analysis
   - Validation results

# Design System Version Control
design_version_control:
  package_tracking:
    components:
      - Package-specific components
      - Shared components
      - Component variants
      - Version alignment
    patterns:
      - Package design patterns
      - Cross-package patterns
      - Pattern evolution
      - Breaking changes
    dependencies:
      - Design dependencies
      - Component dependencies
      - Pattern dependencies
      - Version compatibility

  monorepo_tracking:
    structure:
      - Design system organization
      - Package boundaries
      - Shared resources
      - Global patterns
    integration:
      - Cross-package consistency
      - Theme integration
      - Pattern sharing
      - Component reuse
    versioning:
      - Package versions
      - Design system versions
      - Breaking changes
      - Migration paths

  documentation:
    package_docs:
      - Component catalog
      - Pattern library
      - Version history
      - Migration guides
    monorepo_docs:
      - Design system architecture
      - Cross-package guidelines
      - Shared patterns
      - Global standards

  validation:
    package_validation:
      - Component consistency
      - Pattern compliance
      - Version compatibility
      - Documentation completeness
    monorepo_validation:
      - Cross-package consistency
      - Design system integrity
      - Global pattern compliance
      - Integration verification
